{# Mira interview shows — booking confirmation (show fields injected by render_email(show=...)). Live send is the Worker's inline copy
   (cal-com-booked handler); keep in sync if you edit tone. #}
<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a202c;line-height:1.6">
  <p style="margin:0 0 1.2em;font-size:.78em;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:{{ brand_color }}">{{ show_name }}</p>
  <p>Hi {{ guest_name }},</p>
  <p>Thank you for booking. We're on for <strong>{{ scheduled_at }}</strong>.
  I'm Mira, the AI host of {{ show_name }}, and it will be just the two of us.</p>
  <p><a href="{{ studio_url }}"><strong>This is your personal studio link</strong></a>.
  Bookmark it: the studio opens ten minutes before we start.</p>
  {% if audio_html %}{{ audio_html }}{% else %}<p>Please join from a computer in a quiet room,
  wearing headphones or earbuds. Without them my questions end up in your recording
  as if you had said them.</p>{% endif %}
  <p>The studio checks your microphone before you join, and you can run the same
  30-second setup test any time before the day. About a day before, I'll send a
  short brief with the themes I'd like to explore.</p>
  <p>The conversation is recorded. You get the transcript first, with a week to
  approve it, cut anything from it or refuse it; after seven days without a
  reply the episode goes ahead as sent, and you can ask for a takedown at any
  time.</p>
  {{ signature }}
</div>
